OL,3,GNEWSAClaims glass degree move costs
OL,4,Awere inflated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA university has been accused of
OL,7,Foverinflating the costs required to
OL,8,Fsave a region's only degree-level glass
OL,9,Fcourse.
OL,11,FEarlier this year the University of
OL,12,FSunderland ended its 44-year-old glass
OL,13,Fand ceramics programme following the
OL,14,Fclosure of the National Glass Centre
OL,15,F(NGC) where the courses had been based.
OL,17,FThe BBC has obtained a report
OL,18,Fcommissioned by the university on how
OL,19,Fmuch it would cost to move the
OL,20,Fprogramme following the NGC's closure.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39702
