OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F397A1788240396
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAClaims glass degree move costs
OL,4,Awere inflated
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople connected to the university said
OL,7,Fcosts quoted in the report - totalling
OL,8,Fabout #9.4m - had been overinflated.
OL,9,FThe university declined to comment on
OL,10,Fthe accusations and said it had not
OL,11,Fbeen financially viable to save the
OL,12,Fcourses.
